{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y压缩了人物最终的自我安顿，没有像X那样明确交代，即使以后一直没有人亲近，他也愿意自己好好过下去。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句、重点加亮和感受分时出现，让观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每段的情绪转折，不必同时处理整片文字。尤其是旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等反复出现的声音意象，让前后的音乐感受有了联系，细腻程度也明显胜过X较多并列的概括性词语。不过X对人物动机的交代更充分，结尾也更完整，尤其保留了即使始终没有新的亲近关系，他仍愿意独自好好生活这一层重要的心理落点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f70b263f-2a56-4abb-a49e-a9f50cfa2a56", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T071221582955Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:14:12.626685+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "41a0ecce40bb8d2ec96bc758617686eddf3c0cb6f389662116c8c60f434b11ba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme